Mysterious lights reported at sea.

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.084
All right, troops!

00:02:33.084 --> 00:02:36.484
The long-awaited school festival
is only a day away!

00:02:36.954 --> 00:02:40.594
We've been pressed for time,
and it hasn't all been easy,

00:02:40.594 --> 00:02:44.394
but we've come this far, so let's
give it everything we've got!

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:45.854
Yeah!

00:02:46.294 --> 00:02:48.894
At the opening dinner tonight, we'll be...

00:02:56.274 --> 00:02:58.244
Good morning, everyone!

00:02:59.004 --> 00:03:01.444
I just got back.

00:03:01.544 --> 00:03:03.104
Lady Hagino!

00:03:03.274 --> 00:03:04.834
Miss Senkoji!

00:03:06.644 --> 00:03:07.684
You're back!

00:03:07.684 --> 00:03:08.684
Oh, good!

00:03:08.684 --> 00:03:09.684
Miss Senkoji!

00:03:09.684 --> 00:03:10.714
Class rep!

00:03:12.254 --> 00:03:13.744
Good thing you made it in time!

00:03:14.224 --> 00:03:16.384
Is your family okay now?

00:03:16.924 --> 00:03:18.954
Yes, they're fine.

00:03:19.464 --> 00:03:20.464
I'm sorry to have worried you.

00:03:20.464 --> 00:03:21.484
I'm back.

00:03:23.294 --> 00:03:24.734
Welcome back.

00:03:27.374 --> 00:03:29.734
Exquisite harmony.

00:03:33.774 --> 00:03:35.434
Current location: South east of Tori Island.

00:03:36.374 --> 00:03:40.554
Steam and surface disturbances from volcanic
activity are obscuring the view,

00:03:40.554 --> 00:03:44.384
but I'm not detecting any trace of the
strange lights sighted last night.

00:03:56.294 --> 00:03:58.764
Forime patrol aircraft destroyed.

00:03:59.004 --> 00:04:01.734
Fleet Six heading north-northwest.

00:04:02.704 --> 00:04:07.874
According to Arume, the main invasion
fleet will depart shortly.

00:04:08.744 --> 00:04:14.344
Based on the data gathered by our investigation,
we'll launch a one-strike offensive.

00:04:15.184 --> 00:04:19.384
The battle against the Forime
will be an instant victory.

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:23.054
But first...

00:04:23.054 --> 00:04:25.584
There's one little inconvenience
we have to eliminate.

00:04:28.934 --> 00:04:32.194
Blue Ship Five, which is currently rebelling,

00:04:33.064 --> 00:04:37.764
and its pilot, Commander Ekaril. Correct?

00:04:47.314 --> 00:04:49.544
Heave, ho!

00:04:52.654 --> 00:04:55.784
This is Joan of Arc's prison!

00:04:56.154 --> 00:04:58.424
It's okay if you bump it a bit!

00:04:58.694 --> 00:05:00.454
The rest is up to you!

00:05:00.694 --> 00:05:01.824
Wow!

00:05:01.994 --> 00:05:03.724
Speaking of which,

00:05:04.264 --> 00:05:07.534
I'm the jailor woman of this prison!

00:05:08.004 --> 00:05:10.334
You look great, Dorm Chief!

00:05:12.174 --> 00:05:14.204
Now, come on out, you three!

00:05:15.774 --> 00:05:17.044
Er...

00:05:19.544 --> 00:05:21.944
We're the novice nuns!

00:05:22.254 --> 00:05:23.114
It's kinda like...

00:05:23.114 --> 00:05:24.884
...it isn't really us...

00:05:24.884 --> 00:05:26.224
...how embarrassing!

00:05:26.224 --> 00:05:27.714
You look fine!

00:05:27.854 --> 00:05:29.444
You're plenty cute!

00:05:31.094 --> 00:05:32.724
And I am...

00:05:32.864 --> 00:05:35.924
...the warrior who once battled at Joan's side...

00:05:37.404 --> 00:05:39.394
...Matthias the Knight!

00:05:41.504 --> 00:05:43.304
Hey! Whoa, there!

00:05:43.804 --> 00:05:49.034
Wow, what a heartthrob!
The ladies love the manly type!

00:05:49.174 --> 00:05:53.774
Shut up! Hey, let go, will you?!

00:05:54.184 --> 00:05:56.484
Miss Senkoji? Are you ready?

00:05:57.354 --> 00:05:58.284
Yes...

00:06:03.624 --> 00:06:06.154
Is this all right?

00:06:07.494 --> 00:06:09.964
It's not too revealing?

00:06:10.464 --> 00:06:11.934
Not at all!

00:06:12.004 --> 00:06:12.934
It's fabulous!

00:06:12.934 --> 00:06:14.234
Too fabulous!

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:16.634
You think so?

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:26.184
Teacher!

00:06:26.184 --> 00:06:30.944
Wonderful! I'm so impressed!

00:06:31.324 --> 00:06:35.094
The settings, costumes, lighting, music...

00:06:35.094 --> 00:06:37.614
It's all so fantastic!

00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:40.994
You've done a great job!

00:06:41.834 --> 00:06:43.794
We're not done yet!

00:06:44.064 --> 00:06:46.134
Tomorrow's the big day!

00:06:46.134 --> 00:06:50.504
Um, Teacher? I need to ask you something...

00:06:51.674 --> 00:06:53.834
You've really worked hard, Miss Kozuki!

00:06:54.044 --> 00:06:55.344
We're not quite there!

00:06:55.944 --> 00:06:59.214
The sets and the staging just
need a little more work...

00:06:59.944 --> 00:07:01.614
I was wondering...

00:07:02.684 --> 00:07:03.824
Very well.

00:07:03.824 --> 00:07:08.254
I'll arrange for you to have
use of the hall overnight!

00:07:10.294 --> 00:07:13.824
Got that? We're pulling an all nighter tonight!

00:07:14.034 --> 00:07:16.194
Yeah!

00:07:18.964 --> 00:07:20.334
Kamioki Island...

00:07:21.004 --> 00:07:26.104
You engineered the accident
that befell Ship Five!

00:07:26.604 --> 00:07:29.334
Isn't that so, Master Commander?

00:07:32.584 --> 00:07:35.454
You caused the Emil Force Drive to malfunction

00:07:35.454 --> 00:07:39.444
so that psycho-reactive waves would
leak through the faulty shield,

00:07:39.624 --> 00:07:45.994
exposing the Forime, and the Arume, too!
To test the effects!

00:07:48.264 --> 00:07:57.634
Now you're intent on eradicating Blue
to erase the evidence! Isn't that so?

00:07:58.544 --> 00:08:02.034
And what if it is?

00:08:02.344 --> 00:08:03.404
If it is...

00:08:10.384 --> 00:08:11.254
Don't move!

00:08:12.654 --> 00:08:17.144
Master Commander Shivariel!
You killed Onomil!

00:08:18.624 --> 00:08:20.324
Prepare to die!

00:08:26.264 --> 00:08:29.634
Whew! Tomorrow's the big day!

00:08:30.104 --> 00:08:31.734
I hope we do okay!

00:08:31.804 --> 00:08:33.844
I'm kinda nervous!

00:08:33.844 --> 00:08:35.434
Yeah, me too!

00:08:35.714 --> 00:08:39.904
You'll be just fine! You're really good!

00:08:40.114 --> 00:08:41.584
Do you mean that?

00:08:42.114 --> 00:08:44.514
You're just saying that!

00:08:44.584 --> 00:08:46.914
Not at all! Really!

00:08:48.054 --> 00:08:51.084
I admire you guys...

00:08:51.264 --> 00:08:57.294
Oh, right. You don't have a costume since
you're playing a modern high school girl!

00:08:58.104 --> 00:08:59.564
Wanna trade with me?

00:08:59.804 --> 00:09:01.434
In your dreams!

00:09:01.434 --> 00:09:02.874
I knew it!

00:09:05.104 --> 00:09:08.094
Yeah. The costumes, too...

00:09:09.444 --> 00:09:15.074
But also the way everyone worked
together towards a common goal...

00:09:15.754 --> 00:09:20.124
Don't count yourself out!
You're playing the lead!

00:09:20.654 --> 00:09:23.984
Yeah, I know, but...

00:09:24.494 --> 00:09:25.584
Mari...

00:09:26.124 --> 00:09:30.224
I think I know what she's saying.

00:09:31.704 --> 00:09:36.034
I think Mari's not just talking about the play.

00:09:38.244 --> 00:09:44.804
I graduate next year, so this is
my last school festival.

00:09:48.214 --> 00:09:50.414
It's the same for all of us, right?

00:09:50.784 --> 00:09:57.624
We'll only experience this school festival once.
Ordinary days, too, are once-in-a-lifetime events.

00:09:58.424 --> 00:10:01.824
We're the stars of each day of our lives!

00:10:03.694 --> 00:10:07.764
I think the play Kozuki wrote
is a really wonderful story!

00:10:09.134 --> 00:10:12.404
I'm really glad to have a role in it!

00:10:13.104 --> 00:10:19.534
Let's all work together and
make it the greatest day ever!

00:10:20.244 --> 00:10:21.714
Dorm Chief...

00:10:21.714 --> 00:10:23.154
She's right!

00:10:23.154 --> 00:10:24.454
Let's do it!

00:10:24.454 --> 00:10:25.884
Right on!

00:10:26.424 --> 00:10:27.514
Totally.

00:10:27.754 --> 00:10:30.414
Hey... where's Hagino?

00:10:30.624 --> 00:10:34.564
Lady Hagino?
Teacher Yuko wanted to talk to her...

00:10:34.564 --> 00:10:35.594
Yeah, yeah!

00:10:35.594 --> 00:10:36.694
Oh, no!

00:10:36.764 --> 00:10:42.034
I have to turn in the application
to use the hall! See you later!

00:10:44.204 --> 00:10:45.834
We'll practice again this afternoon!

00:10:45.974 --> 00:10:47.444
Oh, yes!

00:10:51.214 --> 00:10:52.114
By the way...

00:10:52.114 --> 00:10:52.784
Yes?

00:10:52.784 --> 00:10:55.844
About the speech you just gave...

00:10:56.484 --> 00:10:57.614
What now?

00:10:57.724 --> 00:11:00.484
You really think you can graduate on time?

00:11:30.724 --> 00:11:33.284
It's just as you say, Azanael.

00:11:34.024 --> 00:11:38.724
Ship Five's accident was planned before
its departure from Arume.

00:11:48.274 --> 00:11:51.894
But the true purpose of the test

00:11:52.474 --> 00:11:59.004
was to study the substance obtained through a
critical reaction to the Emil Force Drive...

00:12:00.344 --> 00:12:03.874
...for our Thought Condensing Weapon.

00:12:07.554 --> 00:12:09.584
What are you waiting for? Get her!

00:12:18.804 --> 00:12:21.034
Fire alert in central conference room!

00:12:21.034 --> 00:12:24.804
Seal fire doors and send security to
the designated block immediately!

00:12:24.974 --> 00:12:28.244
Chief Azanael is on the lose. Personnel are
instructed to eliminate her on sight!

00:12:28.244 --> 00:12:29.434
That fool!
Chief Azanael is on the lose. Personnel are
instructed to eliminate her on sight!

00:12:33.014 --> 00:12:34.514
Chemistry Lab

00:12:34.514 --> 00:12:38.474
Chemistry Lab
Sorry to call you in at such a busy time!

00:12:38.854 --> 00:12:43.414
No, it's all right.
Besides, you said it was important.

00:12:43.824 --> 00:12:47.694
Yes. I called you in because...

00:12:54.534 --> 00:13:01.174
I want to know what you aliens want from us,
and who you really are.

00:13:05.884 --> 00:13:10.074
We'll get through the lighting this afternoon,
and the sets will be done tonight...

00:13:13.254 --> 00:13:15.684
An invasion?

00:13:17.964 --> 00:13:22.594
In a few days, an immense fleet
will attack this planet.

00:13:22.934 --> 00:13:26.734
No... It can't be... Can it?

00:13:28.134 --> 00:13:29.364
I'm afraid so.

00:13:31.504 --> 00:13:33.774
Not you, too! Miss Senkoji?

00:13:34.004 --> 00:13:37.774
Not me! I want...

00:13:38.714 --> 00:13:41.774
...to protect this planet.

00:13:45.784 --> 00:13:47.154
Do you think we have enough?

00:13:47.154 --> 00:13:49.854
I don't know. If we run out,
we can always get more!

00:13:49.854 --> 00:13:50.254
Auditorium
11th Grade
Kozuki
I don't know. If we run out,
we can always get more!

00:13:50.254 --> 00:13:50.764
