11th Grade
Kozuki
This time...

00:14:07.474 --> 00:14:08.804
Azanael!

00:14:09.214 --> 00:14:10.374
What?!

00:14:11.744 --> 00:14:13.734
You're just as wild as ever!

00:14:16.614 --> 00:14:19.314
Onomil... is that you?

00:14:19.854 --> 00:14:22.724
Don't you know me? Sheesh!

00:14:27.164 --> 00:14:28.524
I've missed you!

00:14:29.934 --> 00:14:32.594
I missed you too, Onomil!

00:14:33.234 --> 00:14:36.104
I know. After all...

00:14:37.204 --> 00:14:40.074
I'm a figment of your deepest longings!

00:14:40.074 --> 00:14:41.444
What?!

00:14:44.144 --> 00:14:45.344
No!

00:14:51.654 --> 00:14:54.054
We all are!

00:14:58.164 --> 00:14:59.854
Now, that's not nice!

00:15:01.464 --> 00:15:07.404
Is it because I'm the product of
your desires and fears?

00:15:12.144 --> 00:15:13.404
Impressed?

00:15:13.874 --> 00:15:16.534
With our Thought Condensing Weapon,

00:15:17.214 --> 00:15:23.014
we should easily rule the Forimes
for the next thousand years.

00:15:24.824 --> 00:15:27.414
Harnessing their own fears...

00:15:47.374 --> 00:15:48.404
Is she dead?

00:15:48.544 --> 00:15:49.404
Yes.

00:15:49.574 --> 00:15:51.274
What a troublemaker!

00:15:53.484 --> 00:15:55.954
Pre-Festival Event

00:15:56.214 --> 00:15:57.484
Hurry, hurry!

00:15:57.724 --> 00:15:59.414
Don't run! You'll fall!

00:15:59.754 --> 00:16:00.984
Awesome!

00:16:01.354 --> 00:16:02.524
Isn't it?

00:16:02.524 --> 00:16:04.894
Cotton candy from the Library Committee!

00:16:04.894 --> 00:16:07.084
Get your crepes from the Tea Club!

00:16:09.534 --> 00:16:12.094
Step right up, step right up!

00:16:12.464 --> 00:16:15.404
Get your fresh-squeezed fruit juice!

00:16:15.474 --> 00:16:16.904
One, please!

00:16:16.904 --> 00:16:18.164
Two for me!

00:16:18.374 --> 00:16:19.474
Coming!

00:16:19.474 --> 00:16:23.174
Darling, you're going to embarrass Michiko!

00:16:23.314 --> 00:16:30.684
Come on! Even rich girls at a fancy school
get hungry and thirsty, right?

00:16:31.154 --> 00:16:32.344
Thank you!

00:16:32.884 --> 00:16:34.544
You're welcome!

00:16:34.824 --> 00:16:39.524
Besides, tomorrow's my only
daughter's big day!

00:16:40.934 --> 00:16:45.194
Sorry, dear. You're dad's all fired up.

00:16:47.204 --> 00:16:49.134
Hmm? You okay?

00:16:49.834 --> 00:16:52.834
Do you feel sick? Michiko!

00:16:53.474 --> 00:16:55.404
No! It's nothing!

00:16:55.714 --> 00:16:57.074
You sure?

00:16:57.074 --> 00:17:01.384
Step right up! Get your favorite
Funatsumaru Fisheries special!

00:17:01.384 --> 00:17:04.714
Get your authentic local fish soup!

00:17:04.954 --> 00:17:09.514
Line up, everyone! Five bowls, right?
Thank you!

00:17:10.124 --> 00:17:12.024
Here... want some?

00:17:15.094 --> 00:17:16.324
I'll pass.

00:17:16.664 --> 00:17:18.894
Is that so?

00:17:20.804 --> 00:17:22.534
It's really good...

00:17:22.974 --> 00:17:24.434
Mistress Mari!

00:17:28.644 --> 00:17:29.874
Mr. Hasegawa!

00:17:31.984 --> 00:17:33.244
And Grandmother!

00:17:33.444 --> 00:17:35.914
You look well, Mari!

00:17:36.254 --> 00:17:37.344
Yes!

00:17:38.684 --> 00:17:40.554
Um, Grandmother?

00:17:41.094 --> 00:17:42.524
Since coming to this school...

00:17:42.924 --> 00:17:45.224
That stuff you said to me before?

00:17:46.094 --> 00:17:47.724
Step right up!

00:17:48.834 --> 00:17:50.294
It builds strength!

00:17:50.534 --> 00:17:51.404
Silly!

00:17:51.404 --> 00:17:53.134
Just a taste?

00:17:53.134 --> 00:17:54.624
I said no!

00:17:56.134 --> 00:17:58.804
I think I kind of get it now.

00:17:59.574 --> 00:18:01.404
Thank you, Grandmother.

00:18:06.684 --> 00:18:09.484
There's not much time left, is there?

00:18:10.054 --> 00:18:12.854
Probably only a few days.

00:18:15.524 --> 00:18:20.324
These Forime are truly a mystery...

00:18:20.924 --> 00:18:22.794
What brought that on?

00:18:23.164 --> 00:18:26.934
They're so tiny and feeble...

00:18:28.174 --> 00:18:30.834
and yet they've changed you so, Commander!

00:18:32.144 --> 00:18:34.804
I'm almost jealous!

00:18:37.514 --> 00:18:38.844
I'm not...

00:18:40.384 --> 00:18:42.044
the only one who's changed.

00:18:53.964 --> 00:18:54.694
Well! I should hope we can
defend our own planet!

00:18:54.694 --> 00:18:57.764
Chemistry Lab
Well! I should hope we can
defend our own planet!

00:18:57.764 --> 00:18:58.194
Well! I should hope we can
defend our own planet!

00:18:58.304 --> 00:18:59.394
It's no use.

00:19:01.434 --> 00:19:03.964
Not with Forime technology.

00:19:04.744 --> 00:19:08.734
What on earth do you want?

00:19:11.184 --> 00:19:13.474
What I want?

00:19:16.154 --> 00:19:17.514
Just...

00:19:17.854 --> 00:19:21.814
Just to get through the school festival?

00:19:30.564 --> 00:19:32.764
Is this for me?

00:19:34.704 --> 00:19:36.464
It matches mine!

00:19:37.074 --> 00:19:41.734
So that even when we're apart on assignment,
we'll still be connected.

00:19:43.574 --> 00:19:47.744
A special good luck charm from me!

00:19:49.414 --> 00:19:50.884
Onomil...

00:19:53.924 --> 00:19:55.484
She's done for.

00:19:55.894 --> 00:19:57.884
Hey, call the clean-up crew.

00:19:57.994 --> 00:19:59.164
Roger.

00:19:59.164 --> 00:20:05.934
Renegade soldier in custody in Hangar 3.
She doesn't have long. Send a clean-up crew.

00:20:23.254 --> 00:20:25.344
Ooh!

00:20:35.064 --> 00:20:38.364
We need to finish our talk, don't we?

00:20:40.064 --> 00:20:46.404
Yes. Not yet. I haven't apologized properly.

00:20:47.914 --> 00:20:48.964
Why...

00:20:50.914 --> 00:20:54.474
Why didn't you tell me?

00:20:56.314 --> 00:20:57.754
I was scared.

00:20:59.484 --> 00:21:01.284
When that accident happened,

00:21:01.694 --> 00:21:06.354
hundreds of people died,
and there was nothing I could do.

00:21:08.194 --> 00:21:11.464
And then I met you.

00:21:17.074 --> 00:21:21.714
I was surprised to learn you'd
survived the accident.

00:21:21.714 --> 00:21:26.344
But also... I was so glad!

00:21:27.784 --> 00:21:29.644
I'm so glad you survived!

00:21:30.114 --> 00:21:33.984
That's why I was frightened
to tell you the truth!

00:21:35.354 --> 00:21:36.944
I thought if I told you...

00:21:38.094 --> 00:21:40.424
This time, I would...

00:21:44.734 --> 00:21:45.894
Mari...

00:21:50.634 --> 00:21:51.904
Mari...

00:21:51.974 --> 00:21:55.564
That was for not telling me the truth!

00:21:57.814 --> 00:21:59.474
And this...

00:22:05.684 --> 00:22:10.524
...this is for making me worry about you!

00:22:22.074 --> 00:22:23.334
You...

00:22:30.344 --> 00:22:31.714
I love you.

00:22:35.214 --> 00:22:36.374
Commander...

00:22:38.824 --> 00:22:41.914
I like it best when you're smiling.

00:22:53.734 --> 00:22:55.704
Barrier wall damage in Hangar 3!

00:23:00.404 --> 00:23:02.404
Azanael's escaping in Getour!

00:23:02.844 --> 00:23:04.004
Shall we go after her?

00:23:04.174 --> 00:23:08.414
Forget her! The fleet's preparing to strike!

00:23:09.354 --> 00:23:12.584
Our objective is to destroy Ship Five!

00:23:13.254 --> 00:23:15.454
All vessels, attack!

00:23:29.534 --> 00:23:37.004
Futari narande te o tsunaida sora ni

00:23:37.814 --> 00:23:47.854
Mirai kasane chikau ano chiheisen

00:23:47.854 --> 00:23:55.524
Kaze ga yasashiku fuki nuketeku youni

00:23:56.234 --> 00:24:04.104
Bokura asu e toketetta

00:24:04.704 --> 00:24:08.314
Nagarete ku toki wa tada

00:24:08.314 --> 00:24:13.644
Shizuka ni kimi wo mimamotte

00:24:13.844 --> 00:24:17.584
Kanashimi mo "Sayonara" mo

00:24:17.584 --> 00:24:23.084
Aoi namida mo tsuyosa ni naru

00:24:24.424 --> 00:24:28.734
Bokura yume kakeru tsubomi

00:24:28.734 --> 00:24:33.564
Kotae sagashi ikiteku

00:24:33.564 --> 00:24:37.874
Hokori takaku saku hana ni

00:24:37.874 --> 00:24:43.574
Itsuka wa nareru to shinjiteta

00:24:43.574 --> 00:24:47.534
In the blue dreams!

00:25:02.394 --> 00:25:09.764
The earth is engulfed in flames as the
aliens wage a full-fledged attack.

00:25:10.374 --> 00:25:12.464
Blue alone rises up against the fleet,

00:25:14.244 --> 00:25:20.574
to protect the planet Hagino has grown to love
and the young girl who has captured her heart.

00:25:22.584 --> 00:25:27.984
Next time on Blue Drop: Rosmarinus.
